# =============================================================================
# 5. PLANNED LINKS (component-level dependencies, plan-time)
# =============================================================================

# The internal-spine edges below were re-derived 2026-05-15 by reading
# the [dependencies] tables of every crate Cargo.toml in commit 293d08d
# (verified facts, not author synthesis). Earlier passes recorded only
# four edges (parser→lexer, semantic→ast, printer→ast, cli→semantic);
# this missed lexer→ast, parser→ast, semantic→parser, eval→ast,
# eval→parser, cli→eval, cli→printer, and the cli→emit-* fan-out
# (recorded as the adapter-implements-port edges below).

